      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/warren-city-tx"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community takes its name from the Warren Petroleum Corporation, a natural gas producer that anchored the local economy.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/warren-city-tx"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Warren City is located within the productive region of the East Texas Oil Field.",
