        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warren_City%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Warren City functions today primarily as a quiet residential community in East Texas.",
